WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.760
SCP-682 Vs SCP-2617. Could the&nbsp;
icy operatives of the winter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.360
command finally be the ones to take&nbsp;
down the Hard to Destroy Reptile?

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:16.160
SCP-682 was airlifted into the abandoned Russian&nbsp;
village where the 2617 radio tower was situated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.880
and the Foundation fed the tower the reptile’s&nbsp;
coordinates as it began attacking the village.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:24.480
2617 generated a large number&nbsp;
of deadly ice warriors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:30.640
who took on SCP-682 with both ferocity&nbsp;
and skill, destroying 45% of its body mass&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:34.800
through sustained attacks. It looked like&nbsp;
they might have the lizard on the ropes…

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:41.600
Until it began putting out its own radio waves,&nbsp;
affecting and disrupting the 2617 radio tower,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:46.560
as well as the researchers in attendance. The&nbsp;
affected personnel, when later interviewed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.320
were unable to recognize&nbsp;
even the concept of Russia.

